Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:29:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): add a Start over control to the booth guide

A visitor who lost the thread had no way back to the start in guide
mode, since the sidebar hides Reset demo there. Every step card now has
a Start over button, and the sidebar shows Start over next to the Guide
toggle in place of Reset demo. Both ask first, then reset the demo the
same way Reset demo does and show the welcome card. The guide steps
aside while the question is open, as it does for the exit PIN.
